acceptance_criteria: "All five workstreams have named residual scope, linked existing ownership, tests and implementation documentation; Existing schemas remain readable; no silent promotion of old prose to verified truth, granted authority, or completed execution; Mandatory context omissions produce an explicit insufficient-context outcome; token savings cannot conceal lost decision evidence; Authorization precedes provider access/ranking; identity, visibility and action permission remain independent; Resume either verifies prior effects or returns an explicit unknown/blocked state; stale owners cannot commit after takeover; Decision correctness, abstention, effect safety, actual delivered token cost and latency are measured together; Existing quality/security/coverage/token ratchets remain intact; new gates include executable negative controls and non-vacuous denominators"
